OL,3,GNEWSAUnion warns 32 police staff could
OL,4,Alose their jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 30 Humberside Police staff
OL,7,Fare at risk of losing their jobs,
OL,8,Faccording to Unison.
OL,10,FThe union is calling on the force to
OL,11,Freconsider plans which it said could
OL,12,Faffect 32 staff, including
OL,13,Finvestigators and domestic abuse teams.
OL,15,FHumberside Police said the changes were
OL,16,Fpart of Operation Balance, which aimed
OL,17,Fto save #5m to make the force
OL,18,Ffinancially stable.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
