OL,3,GNEWSAUnion warns 32 police staff could
OL,4,Alose their jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief Constable Chris Todd said the
OL,7,Fforce had been consulting staff and
OL,8,FUnison, and added: "These are very
OL,9,Fdifficult decisions for us to make."
